BT /F2 16 Tf 56 762.8 Td (Kestrel Shipmanagement - Business Travel and Expense Policy \(FIN-POL-04\)) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 56 720.7 Td (Business Travel and Expense Policy) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56 691.7 Td (Policy Number: FIN-POL-04) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56 677.2 Td (Version: 2.0) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56 662.7 Td (Effective Date: Immediate) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56 648.2 Td (Applicability: Shore Staff of Kestrel Shipmanagement) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 56 606.2 Td (Scope) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56 577.2 Td (This policy establishes the standards, guidelines, and procedures for business travel and) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56 562.7 Td (expense management for all shore-based employees of Kestrel Shipmanagement. The objective is) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56 548.2 Td (to ensure that travel activities are conducted efficiently, cost-effectively, and in) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56 533.7 Td (compliance with internal financial controls while maintaining safety and professionalism.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56 519.2 Td (All shore staff planning or undertaking business-related travel must adhere strictly to the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56 504.7 Td (provisions outlined herein. Failure to comply may result in the denial of reimbursement or) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56 490.2 Td (disciplinary action. This policy applies to all domestic and international travel authorized) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56 475.7 Td (by the company.) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 56 433.6 Td (Travel Booking and Mode of Travel) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56 404.6 Td (Employees are required to utilize the designated corporate travel management system for) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56 390.1 Td (booking flights, trains, and other transportation modes. The mode of travel is determined) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56 375.6 Td (primarily by the distance of the trip to balance cost efficiency with employee comfort and) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56 361.1 Td (time management.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56 332.1 Td (For domestic trips over 500 km: air travel in economy class. Trips of 500 km or less: train) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56 317.6 Td (in AC 2-tier. Employees must select the most direct route available unless a deviation is) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56 303.1 Td (explicitly approved for operational reasons. First-class or business-class upgrades are not) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56 288.6 Td (permitted under any standard circumstance. If no direct train service exists for shorter) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56 274.1 Td (distances, air travel may be considered only with prior written justification and approval) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56 259.6 Td (from the department head, subject to budget availability.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56 230.6 Td (International travel bookings must be made through the corporate travel agent to leverage) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56 216.1 Td (negotiated rates. Employees are expected to book economy class tickets exclusively. Any) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56 201.6 Td (request for premium seating or lounge access must be pre-approved in writing by the CFO,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56 187.1 Td (demonstrating a clear business necessity that outweighs the additional cost.) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 56 145.1 Td (Accommodation) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56 116.1 Td (Hotel accommodations must be booked through the approved corporate hotel partners where) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56 101.6 Td (possible to ensure compliance with negotiated rates and simplified billing processes. When) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56 87.1 Td (booking outside of partner networks, employees must ensure the selected property meets) Tj ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 56 28 Td (Kestrel Shipmanagement \(fictional company\) - FIN-POL-04 v2.0 - page 1 of 4) Tj ET
