BT /F1 10 Tf 56 771.5 Td (safety and hygiene standards.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56 742.5 Td (The company enforces strict nightly limits on accommodation costs based on the location of) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56 728.0 Td (the business trip. Hotel limits per night: INR 6,500 in metro cities \(Mumbai, Delhi,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56 713.5 Td (Chennai, Bengaluru, Kolkata, Hyderabad\); INR 4,000 in all other cities. These limits are) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56 699.0 Td (inclusive of taxes and service charges. If a hotel room exceeds these limits due to limited) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56 684.5 Td (availability during peak seasons or major events, the employee must seek prior approval from) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56 670.0 Td (their line manager. Such approvals will be granted only if the rate difference is justified) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56 655.5 Td (by proximity to the business venue or safety concerns. Excess costs not covered by prior) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56 641.0 Td (approval will be borne by the employee.) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 56 598.9 Td (Daily Allowance) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56 569.9 Td (To simplify expense reporting and cover incidental costs such as meals, local) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56 555.4 Td (transportation, and miscellaneous expenses, the company provides a daily allowance \(per) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56 540.9 Td (diem\). This allowance is intended to replace the need for submitting individual receipts for) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56 526.4 Td (minor food and transport items, provided the total daily spend does not significantly exceed) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56 511.9 Td (the allowance.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56 482.9 Td (Daily allowance: INR 1,200 per day for domestic travel; USD 60 per day for international) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56 468.4 Td (travel. The allowance is calculated based on the number of full days spent on business) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56 453.9 Td (travel. For partial days, the allowance is prorated according to the time spent away from) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56 439.4 Td (the regular duty station. Allowances are not paid for days where meals or transportation are) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56 424.9 Td (provided by the host company or client. Employees must declare any such provisions in their) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56 410.4 Td (expense claim to avoid double-dipping.) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 56 368.4 Td (International Travel) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56 339.4 Td (International travel involves additional logistical and financial considerations, requiring) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56 324.9 Td (stricter advance planning and higher-level authorization. All international travel needs a) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56 310.4 Td (travel request at least 21 days before departure and approval from the CFO. This lead time) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56 295.9 Td (allows for proper visa processing, flight booking at optimal rates, and budget allocation.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56 266.9 Td (Employees must submit a comprehensive travel itinerary along with the request, including) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56 252.4 Td (estimated costs for flights, accommodation, and daily allowances. The CFO will review the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56 237.9 Td (business justification, budget impact, and necessity of the trip before granting approval.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56 223.4 Td (Late requests submitted without valid emergency justification may be rejected or subject to) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56 208.9 Td (higher booking costs, which the employee may need to cover personally if no exception is) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56 194.4 Td (granted.) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 56 152.3 Td (Travel Advances) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56 123.3 Td (In certain cases, employees may request a travel advance to cover initial expenses such as) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56 108.8 Td (visa fees, deposits, or immediate cash needs upon arrival. The company permits a Travel) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56 94.3 Td (advance: up to 70% of the estimated trip cost. The "estimated trip cost" must be calculated) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56 79.8 Td (using current exchange rates and confirmed quotes for flights and accommodation.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 56 28 Td (Kestrel Shipmanagement \(fictional company\) - FIN-POL-04 v2.0 - page 2 of 4) Tj ET
