BT /F1 10 Tf 56 656.9 Td (Special protocols apply when shore staff visit vessels or port facilities, as these) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56 642.4 Td (environments present unique safety and security requirements. Safety is the paramount) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56 627.9 Td (concern during such visits. Ship visits: the company issues personal protective equipment) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56 613.4 Td (\(PPE\); a port pass is arranged through the port captain at least 2 working days before the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56 598.9 Td (visit.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56 569.9 Td (Employees must ensure that all issued PPE is in good condition and worn correctly during the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56 555.4 Td (visit. Failure to wear appropriate PPE may result in immediate denial of entry to the vessel) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56 540.9 Td (or port area. The port pass is mandatory for access to restricted areas; visiting without a) Tj ET
